msgstr "Actualmente, Quarkus admite la  link:{orm-doc-url-prefix}#multitenacy-separate-database[base de datos separada] y el enfoque de  link:{orm-doc-url-prefix}#multitenacy-separate-schema[esquema separado]."

#, fuzzy
msgid "To see multitenancy in action, you can check out the link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/hibernate-orm-multi-tenancy-schema-quickstart[hibernate-orm-multi-tenancy-schema-quickstart] or link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/hibernate-orm-multi-tenancy-database-quickstart[hibernate-orm-multi-tenancy-database-quickstart]."
msgstr "Para ver la link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/hibernate-orm-multi-tenancy-database-quickstart[multitenencia] en acción, puede consultar link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/hibernate-orm-multi-tenancy-database-quickstart[hibernate-orm-multi-tenancy-schema-quickstart] o link:{quickstarts-tree-url}/hibernate-orm-multi-tenancy-database-quickstart[hibernate-orm-multi-tenancy-database-quickstart] ."

